      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<h2 data-start=\"6310\" data-end=\"6342\">Level 6 — <strong data-start=\"6323\" data-end=\"6342\">Silence of Will</strong></h2><p data-start=\"6344\" data-end=\"6360\">You break focus.</p><h3 data-start=\"6362\" data-end=\"6384\">Mechanical Effects</h3><p data-start=\"6385\" data-end=\"6401\">Targets you hit:</p><ul data-start=\"6402\" data-end=\"6499\"><li data-start=\"6402\" data-end=\"6449\"><p data-start=\"6404\" data-end=\"6449\">roll 3d10 keep lowest 2 on <strong data-start=\"6425\" data-end=\"6449\">Clarity hold checks</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"6450\" data-end=\"6499\"><p data-start=\"6452\" data-end=\"6499\">Cannot benefit from rallying or command effects</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"6501\" data-end=\"6516\">At <strong data-start=\"6504\" data-end=\"6515\">Burn 3+</strong>:</p><ul data-start=\"6517\" data-end=\"6604\"><li data-start=\"6517\" data-end=\"6604\"><p data-start=\"6519\" data-end=\"6604\">Failing a Clarity hold check also causes <strong data-start=\"6561\" data-end=\"6582\">Burn-like fatigue</strong> (GM narrative effect)</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"6606\" data-end=\"6635\">Hope stops organizing itself.</p>",
